0 HEAD
1 SOUR genimerge
2 NAME genimerge samaritan-sources
2 CORP Emma Leonhart
1 GEDC
2 VERS 5.5.1
2 FORM LINEAGE-LINKED
1 CHAR UTF-8
1 NOTE Israelite Samaritan genealogy transcribed from published sources.
2 CONT NOT a Geni export. No profile IDs. See reports/samaritan-priesthood.md
2 CONT and reports/samaritan-families.md for the sources and the reasoning.
2 CONT Individuals with no NAME are explicit placeholders; read their NOTE.
0 @I1@ INDI
1 NAME Aaron /ben Amram/
1 SEX M
1 OCCU High Priest
1 NOTE The priest, brother of Moses. Head of both priestly lines.
2 CONT Source: A.B. - The Samaritan News / The Samaritan Update, March-April 2012, 'The High Priesthood and the Israelite Samaritan Priests', by Benyamim Tsedaka
1 FAMS @F1@
0 @I2@ INDI
1 NAME Itamar /ben Aaron/
1 SEX M
1 OCCU priest
1 NOTE Younger son of Aaron. The 'Abtah (Haftawi) priests descend from him; the Phinhas high-priestly line descends from his brother
2 CONT Eleazar. Source: A.B. - The Samaritan News / The Samaritan Update, March-April 2012, 'The High Priesthood and the Israelite Samaritan Priests', by Benyamim Tsedaka
