1 NAME 'Abed Ela /ben Shalma/
1 SEX M
1 TITL President of the House of 'Abtah
1 OCCU priest, poet, translator
1 NOTE Forefather of the current Israelite Samaritan priestly families.
2 CONT Born and active in Damascus, then moved to Nablus to serve the
2 CONT high priests. Great poet, translator and teacher of religion.
2 CONT 'Abtah means Translator (Arabic: Haftawi) - the Itamar priests
2 CONT rendered the Phinhas High Priest's Hebrew reading of the
2 CONT Pentateuch into Aramaic, and are named for that duty.
2 CONT Source: A.B. - The Samaritan News / The Samaritan Update, March-April 2012, 'The High Priesthood and the Israelite Samaritan Priests', by Benyamim Tsedaka
