1 NAME Shalmaiah /ben Phinhas/
1 SEX M
1 TITL Samaritan High Priest
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1624
1 OCCU High Priest
1 NOTE The LAST High Priest of the family of Phinhas. Died 1624 after
2 CONT serving eleven years, leaving only one daughter, which ended the
2 CONT line of Eleazar son of Aaron. He disappeared travelling from
2 CONT Nablus to the Samaritans of Gaza; the 17th-century poet Marchiv
2 CONT ben Jacob wrote to Europe that 'the last Rabban died in our time'.
2 CONT Source: A.B. - The Samaritan News / The Samaritan Update, March-April 2012, 'The High Priesthood and the Israelite Samaritan Priests', by Benyamim Tsedaka
