1 NOTE Established the Samaritan neighbourhood in Holon and directed its
2 CONT development; bought the sandy ground the community first camped on
2 CONT in 1951. Head of the Samaritans outside Shechem until his death in
2 CONT 1982.
2 CONT Sources: Israelite Samaritan Information Institute, families page; 'The Tsedaka Family', theSamaritanUpdate.com, 2008
