1 NAME Batia /bat Yefet/
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1926
1 OCCU teacher, school principal in the Dan District
1 NOTE First daughter of Yefet ben Abraham. About four years younger than
2 CONT her husband Ratson, whom she married in 1943, moving from Tel Aviv
2 CONT to Nablus. Completed teachers' seminary and became a school
2 CONT principal in the Dan District. The best-documented Samaritan woman
2 CONT found in these sources.
2 CONT Source: 'Ratson b. Benyamim Tsedaka - 90 Years to His Birthday', Benyamim Tsedaka, 2012
