0 @I162@ INDI
1 NAME Yishmael /ben Ab-Sikuwwa/
1 SEX M
1 OCCU secretary (Kateb Sirri)
1 NOTE Served as a secretary in the Shechem administration (Arabic:
2 CONT Kateb Sirri), and gave his name to Dar Sirrawi, the oldest branch
2 CONT of the Dinfi household.
2 CONT Source: Israelite Samaritan Information Institute, families page
