0 @I165@ INDI
1 NAME 'Abed Hanuna /ben Jacob Hadinfi/
1 SEX M
1 NOTE Nicknamed 'Iltafe' - handsome - and the branch took its name from
2 CONT the nickname: ALTIF (Dar Iltafe). This is the origin of the Altif
2 CONT family, into which the Ukrainian marriages of the 2000s were made
2 CONT (Alexandra Kraskuk to Wadah Altif, c.2003; Alla Evdokimova to
2 CONT Azzam Altif, c.2011).
2 CONT Source: Israelite Samaritan Information Institute, families page
1 FAMC @F141@
