1 NAME Marchiv /ben Jacob ben Yusef/
1 SEX M
1 OCCU poet, writer
1 NOTE 17th century. Wrote many letters to Europe, and in one of them
2 CONT settled the mystery of the last Phinhas High Priest's
2 CONT disappearance: 'the last Rabban died in our time'.
2 CONT Sources: Israelite Samaritan Information Institute, families page; A.B. - The Samaritan News / The Samaritan Update, March-April 2012, 'The High Priesthood and the Israelite Samaritan Priests', by Benyamim Tsedaka
0 @I174@ INDI
1 NAME Abraham /ben Yashishakar/
1 SEX M
1 NOTE A named figure of the Marchiv household.
2 CONT Source: Israelite Samaritan Information Institute, families page
0 @I175@ INDI
1 NAME Abraham /ben Marchiv Hamarchivi/
1 SEX M
1 OCCU sage
1 NOTE A Samaritan wise man of Holon and a close friend of Ratson ben
2 CONT Benyamim; with him and Yisrael ben Gamliel printed copied Torah
2 CONT manuscripts and prayer books for community use. Distinct from
2 CONT Abraham ben Marchiv Hassafari of the Tsedaka household.
2 CONT Source: 'Ratson b. Benyamim Tsedaka - 90 Years to His Birthday', Benyamim Tsedaka, 2012
